  },
  {
   "d": "2022-04-12",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The board is confident of delivering a performance for the full year in line with current market expectations, given a strong start to trading in the first quarter.",
   "file": "20220412_SAAS_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-07-28",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Full-year revenue and profit to be in line with market expectations",
   "file": "20220728_SAAS_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-09-26",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We are delivering against the targets we have set for ourselves and remain confident of meeting market forecasts for the full year.",
   "file": "20220926_SAAS_Interim-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-01-31",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "Furthermore, Microlise has carefully managed the supply chain disruption, improving its cost controls and the efficiency of the business, such that margins have improved with EBITDA slightly ahead of market expectations.",
   "file": "20230131_SAAS_FY2022-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-03-30",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "The outlook for Microlise is positive and we have entered FY23 in a strong position, with the Group trading in line with Board expectations since the start of the new financial year.",
   "file": "20230330_SAAS_Final-Results-for-the-12-Months-ended-31-Dec.22.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-07-25",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "As a result, the Company is confident of meeting market expectations for revenue, profit and cash for the full year.",
   "file": "20230725_SAAS_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-09-28",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Whilst it is sensible to look to the future with a degree of caution, given the continuing global macro-economic challenges, the Company's positive trading performance during the period and proven ability to navigate these challenges, underpin the Board's confidence that the Group's performance for FY23 will be in line with market expectations.",
   "file": "20230928_SAAS_Interim-Results-for-the-Six-Months-to-30-June-2023.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-01-30",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "Revenue is anticipated to increase by 13% to £71.7m (FY22: £63.2m) with adjusted EBITDA2 growth of 14%, slightly ahead of market expectations3.",
   "file": "20240130_SAAS_FY2023-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-04-09",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We started the new financial year in line with our expectations and remain very confident with the opportunities we have in front of us, and in our ability to deliver against market expectations.",
   "file": "20240409_SAAS_Results-for-the-year-ended-31-December-2023.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-07-30",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Following the strong customer wins in H1, Microlise has a strong order book of projects, either in delivery or for delivery in H2 2024, giving it confidence in meeting full year expectations for 2024.",
   "file": "20240730_SAAS_HY2024-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-09-24",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Company looks to the future with confidence and expects to meet market forecasts for the full year.",
